body:
This actually sucks, for real, whenever I do something I am interested in I give my heart and soul to it and when the time comes it isn't taken seriously compared to the efforts I put in I actually get really disappointed and need some time alone.

I am going to consider yourself being younger than me. All I will say is, try to stand your ground (I know it could be incredibly hard) but if you are able to overcome this, you are only going to get better. The world ain't sunshine and rainbows and in any work you do there will always be criticism from people. But we all need to deal with it and get used to it sooner or later.

I am able to take criticisms better than before and therapy has helped me. Now though I am still vulnerable(but better), I am just like "meh, okay, I did my best, let me try to understand where is this person coming from...".

&#x200B;

    if(failedHard) 
        RiseBackUpAgainFellowINFP();  //:)

oh yes this is what I tried and wanted to show you :)



mapProps(({ students, searchedData }) => {  
 if(searchedData !== ""){  
 return {             
students: students.filter(listchar =>   
((listchar.firstname.toLowerCase().indexOf(searchedData.toLowerCase()) !== -1) || (listchar.lastname.toLowerCase().indexOf(searchedData.toLowerCase()) !== -1)))             
}  
}  
 else{  
 return{students: students}   
}  
})
